{
  "pid": "self-medium-06",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "温度模糊控制与输出钳位（重心法 + 历史误差清除）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，用九条规则的温度模糊控制器计算加热功率。\n控制要求：\n1. e = setpoint - temperature；de = (e - ePrev) / scanSeconds，**首拍**或历史被清除时 de = 0；\n2. x = clamp(e / 10.0, -1, 1)，y = clamp(de / 2.0, -1, 1)。量程说明：±10 ℃ 与 ±2 ℃/s 是本演示的满量程假设（对应温度回路约 ±10 ℃、变化率 ±2 ℃/s 的振荡工况；按幅值 ±10 ℃、周期 31.4 s 估算，变化率峰值约 2.0 ℃/s，该假设在演示工况下自洽），换到真实装置应按实际量程重新整定；\n3. 隶属度：μN(z)=max(-z,0)、μZ(z)=1-|z|、μP(z)=max(z,0)；\n4. 九条规则的单点输出：N×N=-30、N×Z=-20、N×P=-10、Z×N=-10、Z×Z=0、Z×P=10、P×N=10、P×Z=20、P×P=30；correction = Σ(w·c)/Σw（重心法），Σw=0 时 correction=0；\n5. power = clamp(bias + correction, 0, 100)，**correction 不钳位**；\n6. fault = NOT sensorValid OR scanSeconds <= 0.0 OR scanSeconds > 10.0；fault、enable=FALSE 或 resetBtn **上升沿**时：power=0、correction=0，并清除历史（ePrev=0、历史标志=FALSE）。复位是边沿命令、不是停机保持命令：按住的时长不影响判定，每拍只认有没有新的上升沿；按住复位期间输出的 0 只在上升沿那一拍成立，之后回到正常模糊计算（历史已清除，所以恢复后的首拍按 de=0 处理）。“首拍/复位后/故障或禁用后恢复的首拍”指历史标志为 FALSE 的那一拍，该拍 ePrev 不参与，de 一律取 0；下一拍起才用正常差分。\n平台适配：原接口 dt（IEC 日期时间类型别名）统一重命名为 scanSeconds；单位秒、类型及原数字断言不变。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "enable",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "自动投入",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "resetBtn",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "复位（上升沿清除历史误差）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "sensorValid",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "温度传感器数据有效",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "setpoint",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度设定值（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "temperature",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "温度测量值（℃）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "scanSeconds",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "本周期时长（s），合法 0 < dt <= 10",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "bias",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "基础输出（%）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "power",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "加热功率输出（%），钳位 0..100",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "correction",
      "data_type": "REAL",
      "description": "模糊修正量（%）",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fault",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "传感器或参数故障",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "加热功率恒在 0..100 之间。",
      "ltl": "G((power >= 0.0) & (power <= 100.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "模糊修正量恒在 ±30 之间（九个单点输出量的极值）。",
      "ltl": "G((correction >= -30.0) & (correction <= 30.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "未投入、复位上升沿或故障时，输出与修正必须归零。",
      "ltl": "G((!enable | rising(resetBtn) | fault) -> (power = 0.0 & correction = 0.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "故障判据：传感器无效或 scanSeconds 越界。",
      "ltl": "G(fault <-> (!sensorValid | scanSeconds <= 0.0 | scanSeconds > 10.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "传感器无效必然判故障（不允许用坏数据继续闭环）。",
      "ltl": "G(!sensorValid -> fault)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S7",
      "text": "故障/禁用之后重新计算的首拍，历史必须已清除：误差为正且超过满量程时只踩 P×Z 一条规则，修正恰为 +20（若历史未清，de 会带出别的值）。",
      "ltl": "G(((prev(fault) | prev(!enable)) & enable & !fault & !rising(resetBtn) & setpoint - temperature >= 10.0) -> correction = 20.0)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S8",
      "text": "故障/禁用之后重新计算的首拍，误差为 0 时修正必须为 0（历史未清则会因 de≠0 给出非零修正）。",
      "ltl": "G(((prev(fault) | prev(!enable)) & enable & !fault & !rising(resetBtn) & setpoint = temperature) -> correction = 0.0)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S9",
      "text": "复位不是保持命令：按住复位（无新上升沿）时不得继续强制清零，必须按正常模糊逻辑出功率。",
      "ltl": "G((resetBtn & prev(resetBtn) & !fault & enable & (bias > 0.0) & setpoint - temperature >= 10.0) -> power > 0.0)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S10",
      "text": "功率为基础输出与修正合成后的钳位；故障、停用或复位上升沿当拍为零。",
      "ltl": "G(((NOT enable OR fault OR (resetBtn AND NOT prev(resetBtn))) -> power = 0.0) AND (NOT (NOT enable OR fault OR (resetBtn AND NOT prev(resetBtn))) -> ABS(power - LIMIT(0.0, bias + correction, 100.0)) <= 0.000001))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S11",
      "text": "11.10补充：有效且使能的非复位拍，输出功率等于基础功率加修正值后裁剪到 0 至 100。",
      "ltl": "G((enable AND !fault AND !rising(resetBtn)) -> power = LIMIT(0.0, bias + correction, 100.0))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S12",
      "text": "11.10补充：有效首拍或历史在上拍被清除后，变化率取零，修正量应等于20倍归一化误差。 浮点比较沿用判分容差 10^-6 × max(1, |期望值|)。",
      "ltl": "G(((enable AND !fault AND !rising(resetBtn)) AND !(prev(enable AND !fault) AND !prev(rising(resetBtn)))) -> ABS(correction - (20.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (setpoint - temperature) / 10.0, 1.0))) <= 0.000001 * MAX(1.0, ABS(20.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (setpoint - temperature) / 10.0, 1.0))))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S13",
      "text": "11.10补充：具有上一拍有效历史时，九规则乘积加权重心等价于20x+10y，x、y均限于[-1,1]；按本拍有效步长计算误差变化率。 浮点比较沿用判分容差 10^-6 × max(1, |期望值|)。",
      "ltl": "G(((enable AND !fault AND !rising(resetBtn)) AND (prev(enable AND !fault) AND !prev(rising(resetBtn)))) -> ABS(correction - ((20.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (setpoint - temperature) / 10.0, 1.0) + 10.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (((setpoint - temperature) - prev(setpoint - temperature)) / scanSeconds) / 2.0, 1.0)))) <= 0.000001 * MAX(1.0, ABS((20.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (setpoint - temperature) / 10.0, 1.0) + 10.0 * LIMIT(-1.0, (((setpoint - temperature) - prev(setpoint - temperature)) / scanSeconds) / 2.0, 1.0)))))",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    }
  ],
